From f549c7468a72993d042201990752cbb4e6ee1a54 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ruscher <rruscher@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 10:08:29 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 134/136] Root menu: Window Maker behaviour for submenus and
 clicks

- Submenus carry their title (title bar style); dragging it tears off a
  copy as a pinned window with the close button, also from torn copies.
- A right click elsewhere on the desktop reopens the menu there; a left
  click outside closes it. Theme changes restyle titles and copies.
- toolkit: wlmtk_menu_events_t::inside_press for sticky menus.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
